{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1410"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge history/modern-history","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/history__modern-history.g3.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",295],["+"," The youngest passenger on board, Millvina Dean, was just nine weeks old; her mother, her brother and she reached a lifeboat, while her father stayed behind and died. She outlived every other survivor and was the last living witness of the sinking of the Titanic when she died in 2009 at the age of 97."],["=",748]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",287],["+"," Der jüngste Passagier an Bord, Millvina Dean, war gerade neun Wochen alt; ihre Mutter, ihr Bruder und sie erreichten ein Rettungsboot, während ihr Vater zurückblieb und starb. Sie überlebte alle anderen Geretteten und war die letzte lebende Zeugin vom Untergang der Titanic, als sie 2009 im Alter von 97 Jahren starb."],["=",738]]}]},
